{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Bookable API",
    "version": "v1",
    "description": "Key-authenticated API over the Bookable salon book, plus signed outbound webhooks.\n\n**Published webhook / event types:** appointment.booked, appointment.rescheduled, appointment.reassigned, appointment.cancelled, appointment.status_changed, appointment.status_corrected.\n**Not published in v1 (by decision, OQ-W6):** override_booked, services_changed, client_changed, time_released, column_pushed, conflict_acknowledged, hours_changed_underneath, notification_skipped_*, client.created, waitlist.*.\n\n**Delivery:** at-least-once; dedupe on the event `id`; `seq` is per-business and increasing in commit order, gapless only if you subscribe to every published type. Signature: `Bookable-Signature: t=<unix>,v1=<hex HMAC-SHA256(secret, \"<t>.<raw body>\")>`, reject |now − t| > 300 s.\n\n**CHANGELOG** (additive changes are not breaking; breaking changes are a /v2):\n- v1 (2026-10-21): first version."
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearer": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "`Authorization: Bearer bk_api_…`, issued by the owner on /staff/integrations."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Problem": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "title",
          "status",
          "code"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "detail": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "code": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "next": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "endpoint": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "why": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "errors": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "field": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "message": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/services": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Active services with durations and segments; prices only with the `prices` scope.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ],
        "x-scope": "read",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Success (JSON)."
          },
          "default": {
            "description": "An error, as RFC 9457 problem+json with `code` and `next`.",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/providers": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Stylists and the services each can do; `serviceIds` narrows to those qualified for the whole visit.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
